-- src:631 | (2) But subsection (1) does not prevent the registration of the company by any name approved by the Secretary of State.
@ref s 57C(2) Names approved by the Secretary of State (src:631-631)
GIVEN `the name is approved by the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN
